00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.500
- It means that we can keep trying,

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:25.020
but there's a good chance
this may never happen for us.

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:33.143
- My God.

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:36.653
- I'm sorry.

00:14:38.030 --> 00:14:38.963
- I'm sorry too.

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.930
- She gave us a great
report, and we are officially

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:45.100
on the waiting list.

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:45.933
- That's great.

00:14:45.933 --> 00:14:47.260
- Now we just have to wait for a call,

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:49.810
and someone tells us there's
a baby waiting for us.

00:14:54.472 --> 00:14:59.472
(phone rings)
(audience laughs)

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:04.463
- Hello.

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:06.970
Have you seen Joey's bat?

00:15:08.195 --> 00:15:10.880
- Do you even know it's your
birthday today, you're one.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:14.278
One year old, that's little.

00:15:14.278 --> 00:15:16.530
- One year.
(Chandler gasps)

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:17.943
- That's my girl.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:21.920
- That's how old you are.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:25.685
- Did I teach her that,
did I just impart wisdom?

00:15:25.685 --> 00:15:28.170
(audience laughs)

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:29.203
- I want one.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:31.833
- Me too.

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:35.640
- I love my wife more then
anything in this world.

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:38.693
And it...

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.793
It kills me that I can't give her a baby.

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:50.693
I really want a kid.

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:54.200
And when that day finally comes,

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:55.800
I'll learn how to be a good dad.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:00.583
But my wife, she's already there.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:02.823
She's a mother,

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:05.953
without a baby.

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:15.123
Please?

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.113
You still want that baby?

00:16:34.286 --> 00:16:39.286
(audience laughs)
(audience cheers)

00:16:40.452 --> 00:16:41.680
- Thank you so much.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:44.090
- I'm really happy for you guys.

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:46.633
- How do you feel?
- I'm tired.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.350
- You don't have that much time to relax,

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:51.627
the other one will be along in a minute.

00:16:51.627 --> 00:16:54.377
(audience gasps)

00:16:56.141 --> 00:16:57.550
(audience cheers)

00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:59.900
- I'm sorry, who should
be along in a what now?

00:17:01.263 --> 00:17:05.551
- Oh my God.
- Welcome home.

00:17:05.551 --> 00:17:06.551
- Oh my God.

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:11.243
- Hey.

00:17:12.199 --> 00:17:13.116
- Hi.
- Hey.

00:17:14.031 --> 00:17:16.160
(gasps)
(audience laughs)

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.719
- Hey so what is the big surprise?

00:17:18.719 --> 00:17:21.531
(audience laughs)

00:17:21.531 --> 00:17:26.531
(Joey gasps)
(audience laughs)

